  "bodyHash": "14ceb53ef4fc8309",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>深色透明 GUI&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">by Pabli</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過透明介面獲得更寬廣的視野。</span></p>\n<p>此材質包將所有圖形使用者介面（GUI 與 HUD）轉為透明且極簡風格，僅保留黑色邊框，讓您在遊戲過程中不受干擾。</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/dark-transparent-gui/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">下載</span><br></a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>選配安裝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.org%252fmod%252frespackopts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a>（v2.3.0+）以啟用設定選單（DTG v3.0+）- 您可選擇不同的背景選單圖片並停用部分紋理<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>，讓 Mojang 標誌載入畫面顯示黑色背景</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/740/crafting.png\" alt=\"合成桌\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/737/inventory_survival.png\" alt=\"生存模式背包\" width=\"600\" height=\"317\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/dark-transparent-gui/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多截圖<br></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">致謝：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Tweaks</a> - 白色文字</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>其他作品：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mojang-black-background\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mojang 黑色背景</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-visibility-of-ores\" rel=\"nofollow\">礦石能見度提升</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br>此材質包也可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdark-transparent-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 取得</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
